    "claims": [
      "Built on BC, Yaveon 365 Dispatch & Packaging and Tasklet Mobile WMS",
      "Guided dialogs for loading, picking, closing dispatch orders and printing package labels",
      "Works offline and syncs once back online",
      "GS1-compatible scanning",
      "Marks shipping units as loaded and updates dispatch order status automatically",
      "Picking with two scans and adding packaging materials to picked goods",
      "Planned or ad hoc movements in a two-step take and place process",
      "Prints labels automatically or manually from dispatch orders",
      "Unknown barcode qualifiers are ignored automatically",
      "Empty bins can be reported immediately to support continuous inventory",
      "Works with BC Essentials and Premium"
    ],
